            <div xml:id="d603">

                <pb facs="0484" n="476" sameAs="frus:frus1937v04/pg476"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115 President Hoover/34: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-31">August 31, 1937</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>198. Your 578, August 31, 10 p.m. General purport of Department’s 194, August 30,
                    4 p.m., has been announced to press here and Department desires that you present
                    note as soon as possible.</p>
                <pb facs="0485" n="477" xml:id="pg477"/>
                <p>You may inform Foreign Office orally that the note is based on instructions sent
                    you on August 30.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
